    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 717,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "DIC Entertainment\nDiC Entertainment ( [ pron\u02c8dik ] was an international film and television production company . The company was also known as The Incredible World of DiC , DiC Audiovisuel , DiC Enterprises , DIC Animation City and DIC Productions at various times in its history . In 2008 , DIC was acquired by the Cookie Jar Group and was folded into it . Most of the DIC library is currently owned by DHX Media after DHX acquired the Cookie Jar Group in October 2012 . In addition to animated and live-action television shows such as Inspector Gadget ( 1983 -- 1986 ) , Heathcliff ( 1984 -- 1988 ) , Dennis the Menace ( 1986 -- 1988 ) , The Real Ghostbusters ( 1986 -- 1991 ) , The Super Mario Bros. . Super Show !"
     }
    ],
